IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bcaa-construction-materials`

-- Building and Construction Authority Act 1999, Part 7 (ss 27-42, 46) and ss 50(4), 52 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_building-and-construction-authority-act-1999.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

